ull,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2024-12-15T22:03:12Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T09:28:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100453","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100453","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100453.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100453.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Enabling this new option fixes GH-97160\r\n\r\n\r\n### **Context / Problem:**\r\nParticles can become desynced from the physics simulation due to its independent frame rate. This is not normally noticeable, but becomes apparent when spawning particles that inherit a high velocity from their parent, e.g. smoke from a fast-moving rocket.\r\n\r\nThis desync happens for two reasons:\r\n1. If `particle frame rate != physics frame rate` (either due to project settings or variable machine frame rate), then the particle continually desyncs with the physics simulation over time.\r\n2. Since particles are updated on the first frame they are created, and the physics update has already ran for that tick, they immediately get ahead of the simulation from the frame of spawning.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### **Fix:**\r\nAdd option  `use_physics_step` (default: false)\r\n\r\nThis does two things, which addresses the above two issues:\r\n1. Synchronizes the particle's update with the physics simulation. Updates at the same tick rate and `delta_time` as the physics simulation.\r\n2. Suppresses particle update on the frame they are spawned.\r\n\r\nNOTE: When this option is enabled, member `fixed_fps` is ignored\r\n\r\n\r\n### **Tests:**\r\nUsing MRP from GH-97160. Tested with both Forward+ and Compatibility renderers.\r\n\r\n`use_physics_step = true`. Note the particles are correctly positioned relative to the rocket barrel.\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fcdd9fee-3366-4d23-8257-9c483f0cc1ef)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/899a076a-9522-4747-8da0-bbabd332bfc2\r\n\r\n\r\n`use_physics_step = false`:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b899098-6c5d-4707-8ddd-cf4f3c5d0443)\r\n\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100453/reactions","total_count":16,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":6,"eyes":4},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100453/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}